{
  "name": "Kenneth's Job Application Automation v2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ SETUP CHECKLIST — Fill before activating\n\n**Credentials to add in n8n (Settings → Credentials):**\n- Groq API → console.groq.com (free)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2\n- Google Docs OAuth2\n- Gmail OAuth2\n\n**Placeholders to replace (Ctrl+H in each node):**\n| Placeholder | Where to get it |\n|---|---|\n| `YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY` | rapidapi.com → JSearch (free 200/mo) |\n| `YOUR_HUNTER_API_KEY` | hunter.io (free 25/mo) |\n| `YOUR_PHONE_NO_INTL` | e.g. 60123456789 (no + sign) |\n| `YOUR_CALLMEBOT_APIKEY` | See WhatsApp node sticky below |\n| `YOUR_N8N_PUBLIC_URL` | Your Cloudflare Tunnel URL |\n| `YOUR_SPREADSHEET_URL` | Google Sheet full URL |\n| `YOUR_RESUME_FOLDER_ID` | Google Drive folder ID from URL |\n| `YOUR_EMAIL` | Your Gmail address |\n\n**Google Sheet tab name: Applications**\nColumns (row 1): jobId | jobTitle | company | location | salary | jobUrl | source | requirements | description | contactName | contactEmail | emailSubject | emailDraft | status | searchDate | appliedDate | resumeDocUrl | emailSent | skippedDate",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup-001",
      "name": "⚙️ Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 CallMeBot WhatsApp Setup (Free)\n\n1. Save +34 644 62 49 90 in your contacts as 'CallMeBot'\n2. Send this WhatsApp message to that number:\n   `I allow callmebot to send me messages`\n3. You'll get a reply with your **apikey** — copy it\n4. Replace `YOUR_CALLMEBOT_APIKEY` in nodes below\n5. Replace `YOUR_PHONE_NO_INTL` with your number\n   (e.g. 60123456789 — Malaysia, no + sign)\n\nNote: Approval works via browser links in WA message.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-callmebot-002",
      "name": "📱 WhatsApp CallMeBot Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2120, -340]
