    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Find the best hiring contact at the company: {{ $('Save Job to Sheets').item.json.company }}\n\nCompany domain (if known): {{ $('Parse Job Results').item.json.companyDomain }}\n\nTarget titles (in order of preference): HR Director, HR Manager, Talent Acquisition, Recruiter, Founder, CEO\n\nUse the Hunter.io tool to search for contacts. Try the companyDomain first. If empty, guess the domain from the company name (e.g. 'Acme Corp' -> 'acmecorp.com' or 'acme.com').\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no explanation):\n{ \"name\": \"First Last\", \"title\": \"HR Manager\", \"email\": \"email@company.com\", \"confidence\": \"high\" }\n\nIf nothing found, return:\n{ \"name\": \"Hiring Manager\", \"title\": \"\", \"email\": \"\", \"confidence\": \"none\" }",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a B2B prospecting specialist. Always use the Hunter.io tool to find real contacts. Try multiple domain variations if the first attempt returns nothing. Return ONLY valid JSON — no markdown, no commentary."
        }
      },
