      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a cold job application email for Kenneth Kensoriano.\n\nJob details:\n- Role: {{ $('Save Job to Sheets').item.json.jobTitle }}\n- Company: {{ $('Save Job to Sheets').item.json.company }}\n- Key requirements: {{ $('Save Job to Sheets').item.json.requirements }}\n- Job description: {{ $('Save Job to Sheets').item.json.description }}\n\nContact: {{ $('Find HR Contact').item.json.output.name ?? 'Hiring Manager' }}\n\nAbout Kenneth:\n- Based in Malaysia, open to full remote roles globally\n- Skills: AI workflow automation (n8n, Make.com), business analysis, customer success, process optimization\n- Fresh graduate / early career, eager and fast learner\n- LinkedIn: [INSERT YOUR LINKEDIN URL]\n\nInstructions:\n- Subject line: under 60 characters, specific to the role\n- Body: 150-200 words\n- Open with something specific about the company or role (NOT 'I hope this finds you well')\n- Highlight 2-3 matching skills from the requirements\n- End with a clear call to action\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON (no markdown, no extra text):\n{ \"subject\": \"...\", \"body\": \"...\" }",
